#, python-brace-format
msgctxt "female"
msgid ""
"We're sorry, but you are not authorized to use the {site_name} website. We "
"have found that some of the information you provided when registering on the "
"site is incorrect or that you have violated the rules of use of the site. "
"Therefore you are not authorized to use the site."
msgstr ""
"Vabandame, kuid teil pole volitust {site_name} veebisaiti kasutada. Oleme "
"avastanud, et osa teie poolt saidil registreerumisel esitatud teabest on "
"valed või olete rikkunud saidi kasutamise reegleid. Seetõttu ei ole teil "
"õigust seda saiti kasutada."

